            "pages": {
              "end": 5,
              "start": 5
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Ginsburg asked whether accepting the petitioner\u2019s view would create a perverse incentive by telling creditors not to investigate immediately."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kennedy",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "4c3b1ed147a5031b470c985be643e1296560b265c9a9aaadfcdc4f84105bea32",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-4c3b1ed147a5-0000-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 6,
              "start": 6
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Kennedy, justice Kennedy inquired whether the issue is different under bankruptcy law and whether the restitution would be dischargeable."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "4c3b1ed147a5031b470c985be643e1296560b265c9a9aaadfcdc4f84105bea32",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-4c3b1ed147a5-0001-0001"
