            "pages": {
              "end": 26,
              "start": 26
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Sotomayor asked whether the bankruptcy\u2011related expenses pertain to attorneys\u2019 fees or corporate officers\u2019 attendance at the hearing."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kagan",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "4c3b1ed147a5031b470c985be643e1296560b265c9a9aaadfcdc4f84105bea32",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-4c3b1ed147a5-0001-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 27,
              "start": 27
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Kagan, justice Kagan questioned whether the fees for sitting in a courtroom during a proceeding should be covered."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Gorsuch",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "4c3b1ed147a5031b470c985be643e1296560b265c9a9aaadfcdc4f84105bea32",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-4c3b1ed147a5-0001-0008"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 37,
              "start": 37
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Gorsuch asked whether the bankruptcy proceeding is related to the offense because fraud was also at issue."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Gorsuch",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "4c3b1ed147a5031b470c985be643e1296560b265c9a9aaadfcdc4f84105bea32",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-4c3b1ed147a5-0002-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 46,
              "start": 46
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Gorsuch further asked whether focusing on individual victims poses a serious problem for the Court."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "4c3b1ed147a5031b470c985be643e1296560b265c9a9aaadfcdc4f84105bea32",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-4c3b1ed147a5-0003-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 68,
              "start": 68
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Sotomayor asked whether the client had pointed out the issue to the district court judge."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Chief Justice Roberts",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "4c3b1ed147a5031b470c985be643e1296560b265c9a9aaadfcdc4f84105bea32",
