  "overview": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioner (Daniel L. Geyser)",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "4c3b1ed147a5031b470c985be643e1296560b265c9a9aaadfcdc4f84105bea32",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-4c3b1ed147a5-0000-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 4,
              "start": 4
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Petitioner (Daniel L. Geyser), the case Sergio Fernando Lagos v. United States concerns whether the Mandatory Victims Restitution Act (MVRA) covers costs such as lost income, child care, transportation, and participation in investigations or prosecutions."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "United States",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "4c3b1ed147a5031b470c985be643e1296560b265c9a9aaadfcdc4f84105bea32",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-4c3b1ed147a5-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 24,
              "start": 24
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The United States argues that the Court should not decide the issue because the case was not properly before the Court and the government did not preserve authority under a different statutory provision."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "United States",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "4c3b1ed147a5031b470c985be643e1296560b265c9a9aaadfcdc4f84105bea32",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-4c3b1ed147a5-0001-0005"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 31,
              "start": 31
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The United States also contends that Congress would not want to burden district judges with fact\u2011intensive restitution disputes given the large number of MVRA proceedings each year."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Respondent",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "4c3b1ed147a5031b470c985be643e1296560b265c9a9aaadfcdc4f84105bea32",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-4c3b1ed147a5-0001-0006"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 33,
              "start": 33
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Respondent, the respondent states that the MVRA enables victims to recover for participation in investigations and is not limited to government\u2011led investigations."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "4c3b1ed147a5031b470c985be643e1296560b265c9a9aaadfcdc4f84105bea32",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-4c3b1ed147a5-0002-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 56,
              "start": 56
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The factual background includes that the defendant stole $25\u202fmillion in less than two years."
      }
    ],
